    "text": "16 hours ago The Childbirth Class that was scheduled for December 5th, 2026, here at the Garrett County Health Department has been CANCELLED. To register for Childbirth Class, or if you are interested in registering for one of our Breastfeeding Classes, please call Early Care Programs at (301) 334-7720. Both classes are FREE! Read full article",
